      "Public job-posting datasets (aggregated listings, role taxonomies) for discovery and matching.",
      "Open interview-question datasets (technical and behavioral) for seeding the dynamic question bank before personalization.",
      "Publicly available company-review and interview-experience text for employer intelligence synthesis (with source attribution).",
